direction: right
Devices: Connected devices {shape: square}
Broker: MQTT broker {shape: queue}
Registry: Device registry {shape: cylinder}
Ingest: Telemetry ingestion {shape: rectangle}
Rules: Rules engine {shape: diamond}
TimeSeries: Time-series store {shape: cylinder}
Alerts: Alert service {shape: rectangle}
Dashboard: Operations dashboard {shape: page}
Commands: Command service {shape: rectangle}
Devices -> Broker: telemetry
Broker -> Registry: authenticate
Broker -> Ingest
Ingest -> Rules
Ingest -> TimeSeries
Rules -> Alerts
TimeSeries -> Dashboard
Dashboard -> Commands
Commands -> Broker: device command
Broker -> Devices
